# React Native Nitro Modules
#
# `nitrogen/` is deliberately NOT ignored. It is generated from the `.nitro.ts`
# specs, but it is also shipped in the npm tarball and referenced by relative
# path from both build systems — and while it was ignored, the `nitrogen-diff`
# CI job could not see drift between a spec and its bindings, because there was
# nothing tracked for the regenerated output to differ from. Committing it is
# what makes that gate real. Generation is deterministic; if this ever produces
# noise in a diff, that is the bug, not the tracking.

# SwiftPM build products from the XCTest harness in Package.swift
.build/
.swiftpm/
